{"parentUuid":"dec57e16-399e-44de-a96c-6e4bb4bb97dd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg5VvytQk75P45pgCPzZe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The access code is off, and the whole app now opens without it. I checked the landing page, the Create page and the status API through the tunnel (all HTTP 200).\n\n**Web link:** https://non-frequencies-trademarks-vegetation.trycloudflare.com\n\n**QR:** I opened it on your desktop as `~/Desktop/mochi-qr.png`. It's a plain link, so no sign-in step. The QR is only on the desktop and not printed here, to keep it out of the public session log.\n\nFor the recording, a good path is: Create, then \"Try a sample product\", then \"Generate now\". The kit takes about 18 seconds.\n\n**Anyone with this link can use the app while it's up.** It runs on your Mac's GPU, so a stranger could use it too. No Shopify store is connected, so nobody can publish anywhere. The tunnel shuts itself down in 3 hours; say \"stop\" and I'll close it sooner.\n\nThe code is only off for this session. To put it back later, tell me and I'll restart the backend with a new one. Your own use is unaffected either way."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":892,"cache_read_input_tokens":653996,"output_tokens":345,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":892,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":345,"cache_read_input_tokens":653996,"cache_creation_input_tokens":892,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":892},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlock