{"parentUuid":"fe78c839-d3a8-497d-b888-0efb854c40d4","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14988744 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8ae49a88-f010-45aa-8360-dd972e02bca5","timestamp":"2026-10-16T07:29:43.848Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14988744 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"d1a90136-ab51-4450-87af-371f07f2f333","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/advikdivekar/Desktop/sellcraft","sessionId":"159a4645-4bae-4261-ac0b-464a7f4accd7","version":"2.1.300","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"8ae49a88-f010-45aa-8360-dd972e02bca5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg5XJytdJGq98EYFGXLzL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, we can make 25-second product videos this way. The setup checks out: HyperFrames is installable here, and your recordings and photos give us enough material. I haven't installed anything yet.\n\n## HyperFrames\n- It's HeyGen's open-source tool (Apache-2.0). You write a video as HTML and CSS with animations, and it renders an MP4. It captures each frame in headless Chrome and encodes with FFmpeg.\n- The npm package `hyperframes` is at version 0.8.163 and needs Node 22 or newer.\n- You have Node 25.6.1 and FFmpeg 9.0.2, so it would run in this terminal.\n- I haven't tried it yet, so I don't know how smooth it is to use here. I'd find that out in the first 10 minutes.\n\n## What I saw in your material\n- **Phone recording:** 3 min 21 s, vertical and sharp (888×1920).\n  - It shows the full real flow: landing, upload, scan, facts, style, building, results (video, copy, photos, share).\n  - The status bar and the tunnel address are visible and will need cropping or masking.\n- **Desktop recording:** 4 min 36 s at 3024×1724.\n  - It has the whole landing page, the create flow, the progress screen and the finished kit, so we can pick the best shots.\n- **Product photos:** 5 photos, 4032×3024.\n  - 4 are held in a hand against a pink wall (2 showing the back label), plus one on a wooden desk and one of the front label.\n  - The desk shot and the front shot are the best for a hero. The hand shots show the back label and the scan features well.\n\n## A 25-second plan\n| Seconds | Content |\n|---|---|\n| 0–3 | Product photo drops in, with the headline \"Your product. Your story. Ready to sell.\" |\n| 3–8 | The phone shot: add photos, the scan fills in the facts |\n| 8–15 | The building screen (the real 18 s clock, sped up), then the kit appears |\n| 15–21 | The generated video ad and the copy panels, with real text from the kit |\n| 21–25 | Mochi logo and a call to action |\n\nI'd cut a 16:9 version from the desktop recording and a 9:16 version from the phone recording.\n\n## Two things to decide first\n- **The product is a real third-party brand** (RASAYANAM Ashwagandha), and the generated copy includes health wording (\"better health in 10 days\" came from the benefit you typed). For a public demo video, that's a trademark and health-claims risk. We could use the abstract sample object instead, or you confirm you have the right to show that brand.\n- **The recordings show your tunnel address.** I'd mask or crop it before any public upload.\n\n## Next step\nReply \"go\", and say which product to feature. I'll install HyperFrames and build a 16:9 version first, so you can judge the look before I make the vertical one.\n\nSource: [HyperFrames, HeyGen's open-source rendering framework (GitHub)](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":824,"cache_read_input_tokens":665926,"output_tokens":1001,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":824,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1001,"cache_read_input_tokens":665926,"cache_creation_input_tokens":824,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":824},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cg5XJyUZytpCwqKVcxBRh","requestRef":"2260e88a-0f13-4020-9199-0f0b0d113428","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c18d5c43-ef21-4ee9-9fa4-222cd0882016","timest