{"parentUuid":"0baf4834-fc59-49f8-a0d4-33b97caaedab","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg5XhG3qKccbBPfe2dG7m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019fB3YbBKJka1oCTx5RqBx3","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/advikdivekar/Desktop/sellcraft && python3 - <<'E'\nd=open('docs/DEVPOST.md').read()\nd=d.replace(\"message with a plain-language one. [TODO: confirm on the phone that Try again now succeeds.]\",\"message with a plain-language one. In my phone recording the same five-photo scan completes and pre-fills the form.\")\nd=d.replace(\"[TODO: live link or the exact local commands] · Code: [TODO: repo link] ·\",\"Code: https://github.com/advikdivekar/sellcraft (local setup is in the README: `ollama pull gemma3:4b`, start the backend and the frontend). A public demo link of the landing page and its in-browser studio: [TODO: add after deploying `render.yaml`] ·\")\nd=d.replace(\"# SellCraft AI\",\"# Mochi\")\nopen('docs/DEVPOST.md','w').write(d)\ns=open('docs/DECISIONS.md').read()\nrows='''| 14 | Rebrand to Mochi. The supplied logo is used on a dark teal tile, the wordmark is live text, the palette is Deep Ocean / Ocean Teal / Turquoise / Ice Blue with Burnt Terracotta used sparingly | One identity across landing page, app and icons; turquoise buttons carry dark text because white on #0FA4AF fails contrast | next commit | [TBD] |\n| 15 | The sample product is an abstract ceramic sphere on a plinth, not an illustrated item | A literal illustrated product looked cartoonish and lowered trust. There are no stock photos in the repo, and the page labels the sample as an illustration | next commit | [TBD] |\n| 16 | \"Fast\" (Gemma 3 4B) is the default writing speed, \"Best quality\" (Gemma 3 12B) is optional | Job stage timings showed copy took 52-105 s while video, deck and assembly together took under 25 s. Fast builds the whole kit in about 18 s | next commit | [TBD] |\n| 17 | The web server proxy waits up to 5 minutes, and server errors say \"took too long\" instead of \"(500)\" | A photo scan over 30 s hit the proxy's default limit and showed a bare 500 on a phone | next commit | [TBD] |\n| 18 | A public demo build (`NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_ONLY=1`, `render.yaml`) serves only the landing page and its in-browser studio | A link that does not depend on one laptop; the full app needs a local model | next commit | [TBD] |\n| 19 | A layout check (`frontend/e2e/layout-overlap.mjs`) measures overlaps at 11 screen sizes and 7 scroll stages | A user screenshot showed a photo covering a card; one size is not enough to catch that | next commit | [TBD] |\n'''\ns=s.rstrip('\\n')+'\\n'+rows\nopen('docs/DECISIONS.md','w').write(s)\nr=open('README.md').read()\nr=r.replace(\"## Tests\\n\",\"## Tests\\n`cd frontend && node e2e/mobile-flow.mjs <url>` walks the whole phone flow in a real browser; `node e2e/layout-overlap.mjs <url>` checks the scroll scene for overlaps at 11 screen sizes.\\n\",1)\nopen('README.md','w').write(r)\nE\ngrep -c \"TBD\" docs/DECISIONS.md; tail -3 /private/tmp/claude-502/pytest-final.log"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":736,"cache_read_input_tokens":673658,"output_tokens":2456,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1231},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":736,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2456,"cache_read_input_tokens":673658,"cache_creation_input_tokens":736,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":736},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_019fB3YbBKJka1oCTx5RqBx3":{"command":"cd /